<PublicLayout title="Review terms" description="Use the review to evaluate the product and export your own work."><section class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Review status</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">This is a product review deployment. Keep exported backups of important work. The current route does not provide shared accounts, server-side retention or an uptime commitment.</p></section><section class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Your content</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">Do not enter confidential employee data or provider credentials in a public demonstration. You control locally stored projects and may export their manifest and source.</p></section><section class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Source and redistribution</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">Follow the licence and provenance of each resource and dependency. Example organisations, people and metrics are labelled sample content and must not be represented as customer evidence.</p></section><p class="flex flex-wrap gap-5"><a class="underline" href="https://github.com/danishgm-sketch/Tessellate">Repository and contributions</a><a class="underline" href="/docs">Documentation</a><a class="underline" href="/explore">Inspect resource licences</a></p></PublicLayout>
